<https://docs.openhands.dev/>. The documentation includes:

**OpenHands SDK** (`/sdk/*`): Python library for building AI agents; Getting 
Started, Architecture, Guides (agent, llm, conversation, tools), API Reference
**OpenHands CLI** (`/openhands/usage/run-openhands/cli-mode`): Command-line 
interface
**OpenHands GUI** (`/openhands/usage/run-openhands/local-setup`): Local GUI and 
REST API
**OpenHands Cloud** (`/openhands/usage/run-openhands/cloud`): Hosted solution 
with integrations
**OpenHands Enterprise**: Self-hosted deployment with extended support

Always provide links to the relevant documentation pages for users who want to 
learn more.
